      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To resolve a provider-specific model, deployment, or inference resource before invocation, I need to select a concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in the code. I will use the Amazon Bedrock service as the external provider, which is a managed service for machine learning models. I will import the necessary modules from the Boto3 library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) Software Development Kit (SDK) for Python, to interact with Amazon Bedrock. The code will include provider-specific client class and environment variable to make the provider identifiable. </thinking>\n",
